<title>UK: City of Moscow sets $500 mln May 2000 bond,+315 bp.</title>
<headline>City of Moscow sets $500 mln May 2000 bond,+315 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CSFB and Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF MOSCOW</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     9.50 PCT  MATURITY    31.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.80     PAY DATE   S06.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+315 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/RU/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  RUSSIA    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  0.5	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT MAY 2000 U.S. TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
